          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.15.47"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 15:47",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Samusoni aja i Gaza, abonayo maraya, yinjira i we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.9.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ivyak 9:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babarira ab’i Gaza, bati Samusoni ashitse hano. Baramuryamira, barāra bamutegeye kw irembo ry’igisagara, bakēsha ijoro ryose banumye, bati Tubanze turorēre buce, duheze tumwice. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko Samusoni ariryamira gushitsa mu gicugu; hageze mu gicugu aravyuka, afata inzugi z’ irembo ry’igisagara, n’ibikingi vyompi vy’irembo, abishingūra vyose hamwe n’igihindizo cavyo, abita ku bitugu, abidūgana ku mpinga y’umusozi urābana n’i Heburoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma y’ivyo agomwa umugore yitwa Delila, yaba ku mwonga Soreki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.13.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 13:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.14.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Abac 14:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ abaganwa b’ Abafilisitiya baja iy’ uwo mugore ari, baramubarira, bati Genda umuhendahende, umenye ah’ inkomezi ziwe nyinshi ziva, n’uburyo twomushobora, kugira ngo tubone kumuboha, tumumare amanyama; nawe tuzoguha amafeza, umuntu wese igihumbi n’ ijana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Delila abarira Samusoni, ati Ndakwinginze, mbarira ah’ inkomezi zawe nyinshi ziva, n’icoshobora kukuboha, ugashira amanyama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.16.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Abac 16:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.16.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samusoni aramwishura, at’ Abombohesha imvuto ndwi zikiri mbisi zitarūma, noca mpinduka goyigoyi, nkamera nk’abandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ abo baganwa b’Abafilisitiya bazanira uwo mugore imvuto ndwi zikiri mbisi zitarūma, arazimubohesha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ uwo mugore yar’ afise abantu babunze mu cumba c’imbere mu nzu; nukw aramubarira, ati Ngaho Samusoni, Abafilisitiya baragushikiriye! Arikw acagagura izo mvuto, nk’uk’ ubugwēgwe bucika bgumvise umuriro. Nukw inkomezi ziwe ntizamenyekana aho ziva.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Delila abarira Samusoni, at’ Ereg’ urampenze, umbariye ibinyoma! Enda se, ndakwinginze, mbarira icoshobora kukuboha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.15.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Abac 15:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.15.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aramwishura, ati Bombohesha imigozi misha itigeze gukoreshwa, noca mpinduka goyigoyi, nkamera nk’abandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Delila yābīra imigozi misha, arayimubohesha, aramubarira, ati Ngaho Samusoni, Abafilisitiya baragushikiriye! Kand’ abāmubundiye bāri mu cumba c’imbere mu nzu. Maze Samusoni aca acagagura iyo migozi imuboshe amaboko, nk’ūcagagura inyuzi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Delila abarira Samusoni, ati Na non’ uracampenda, umbarira ibinyoma gusa! Ntabara umbarire icoshobora kukuboha. Aramwishura, at’ Ibitsibo ndwi vy’ umushatsi wanje wobijishira ku kijisha impuzu, vyoshoboka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukw arabijisha, abigumisha urumambo, maz’ aramubarira, ati Ngaho Samusoni, Abafilisitiya baragushikiriye! Aca arakanguka, ashikura urwo rumambo rw’inshingiro hamwe n’ikijishirwakw impuzu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.16.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
